# Examples

This page demonstrates the authoring features available in your documentation.
Delete it once you have your own content.

## Admonitions

!!! note
    Use `!!!` followed by the type. Add a title in quotes to override the heading.

!!! tip "Best practice"
    Types include `note`, `tip`, `warning`, `danger`, `info`, `example` and `quote`.

??? info "Collapsible"
    Use `???` instead of `!!!` to make it collapsible. Add a `+` (`???+`) to have it start open.

